# --- NEW SITE: black-car-services-nyc ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.blackcarservicesnyc.com   (REQUIRED before launch — canonicals, sitemap and JSON-LD use it)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_LIVE=true                      (set ONLY at launch; until then every page sends X-Robots-Tag: noindex)
# Do NOT reuse Eagle Eye's Stripe / Resend / database / Google keys — create new ones for this site.

# --- Places autocomplete (Book page) — recommended ---
# Server-only key: not exposed in the browser, so HTTP referrer restrictions on the key are NOT required.
# In Google Cloud: enable Places API; restrict this key to "Places API" only; Application restrictions = None.
# See GOOGLE-APIS.md
# PLACES_SERVER_API_KEY=
# Optional alias for the same key:
# GOOGLE_PLACES_SERVER_KEY=
# If you still only have the old browser key set, the server will try it last (Places REST may fail if that key is HTTP-referrer–only):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional: extra hostnames allowed to call /api/places/* (comma-separated suffixes), e.g. myotherdomain.com
# PLACES_ALLOWED_HOST_SUFFIXES=

# --- Email (Resend) — booking + contact form → info@blackcarservicesnyc.com (see lib/contact.ts) ---
# https://resend.com — API key + Domains: add your domain, add DNS records Resend shows (Name/Host may be @ or a subdomain — not “rename”, use the exact Host/Name Resend gives).
# Domain must show “Verified” in Resend before you send from @yourdomain.com.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# Must match a verified domain in Resend (quotes optional around display name):
# EMAIL_FROM=Black Car Service <bookings@blackcarservicesnyc.com>
# Test without your domain (works without DNS): EMAIL_FROM=Black Car Service <onboarding@resend.dev>
# Inbox for new booking/contact alerts (defaults to info@blackcarservicesnyc.com in lib/contact.ts)
# BOOKING_NOTIFY_TO=info@blackcarservicesnyc.com
#
# If booking/contact return 403 Forbidden, your live domain may not be on the allowlist — set:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.yourdomain.com
# and/or PLACES_ALLOWED_HOST_SUFFIXES=yourdomain.com

# --- Google Analytics 4 ---
# When set, AnalyticsPlaceholder loads gtag.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=

# Your live domain (no trailing slash). Set this in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables when you connect a custom domain.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.yourdomain.com

# Google Search Console (HTML tag method): meta verification content only, not the full tag.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# --- Stripe (invoicing with tipping) ---
# https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
# Server-only (Vercel env, NEVER expose in browser code):
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...   or sk_test_... for testing
# Browser-safe publishable key (safe to expose):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_... or pk_test_...
#
# Flow: go to /admin/invoice/new → fill in charges → send to customer.
# Customer opens the link, picks a tip (15/18/20/25% or custom), pays by card.
# Payment processed by Stripe; you get a receipt + Stripe Dashboard record.
